// 2026-10-23 RS VR scopes, REAL mode: XM21.md3 now carries the Ruger's ocular lens as
// its own surface 10 "ScopeGlass" (carved out of 3 leupold_scope by
// kit/tool/md3_carve_surface.py), so every block that uses that mesh needs a
// SurfaceSkin for index 10 -- the blocks that hide the scope must hide the glass too or
// a disc of lens floats beside the dropped magazine. THIS FILE IS GENERATED: gen_rsr.py
// has to learn the scope surface, or the next regenerate drops these lines again.

